{"id": "mission-valley-rock-quarry-royalties", "title": "A Sunol quarry deducted too much from its royalty checks", "seconds": 59.5, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "14f8d2372b04dd0b", "words": 168, "beats": [{"scene": "credit", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco receives royalties from a quarry on water-system land in Sunol.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.19, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["How", "much", "rent", "reached", "the", "water", "system?"], "sub": "Sunol quarry lease"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.81, 1.21, 1.65, 1.82, 1.9, 2.31, 2.44, 3.05, 3.33, 3.5]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "When the City bought material, Mission Valley Rock could deduct a credit.", "t0": 4.31, "t1": 8.11, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "Quarry lease audit", "mark": "Quarry lease audit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.28, 0.55, 0.8, 1.91, 2.3, 2.61, 2.88, 3.05, 3.39, 3.47]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "That credit used the lowest rate charged to its most valued customers.", "t0": 8.23, "t1": 11.67, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The lowest customer rate"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.58, 0.81, 0.93, 1.22, 1.43, 1.79, 1.92, 2.06, 2.29, 2.67]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Auditors compared five months of checks with the amounts due.", "t0": 11.79, "t1": 14.96, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Five months reviewed", "heading": "Royalty checks and calculated royalties", "source": "audit", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Paid", "value": "$474,105"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Calculated due", "value": "$492,733"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.93, 1.23, 1.48, 1.58, 1.96, 2.15, 2.25, 2.61]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "They found at least $18,628 underpaid in those five months.", "t0": 15.08, "t1": 20.24, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$18,628", "label": "Underpayment in the five months tested"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.48, 0.57, 0.8, 1.26, 1.71, 1.93, 2.19, 2.65, 3.03, 3.76, 3.97, 4.23, 4.49]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Lehigh Hanson sold its interest in October 2021, but continued keeping the books.", "t0": 20.36, "t1": 25.95, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "Ownership and reporting", "mark": "Ownership and reporting"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.54, 1.03, 1.32, 1.5, 1.9, 2.03, 2.51, 2.81, 3.86, 4.06, 4.62, 4.98, 5.08]}, {"scene": "credit", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Martin Marietta assumed reporting in May 2022. Auditors could not obtain all the earlier records.", "t0": 26.07, "t1": 32.66, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Reporting changed hands"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.85, 1.23, 1.64, 1.77, 2.05, 2.36, 3.84, 4.32, 4.51, 4.68, 5.1, 5.33, 5.46, 5.84]}, {"scene": "history", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "An earlier audit included the same lease alongside three others.", "t0": 32.88, "t1": 36.3, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "earlier", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor", "text": "2010 Controller audit", "mark": "2010 Controller audit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.58, 0.91, 1.36, 1.49, 1.75, 2.01, 2.58, 2.82]}, {"scene": "history", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "That audit separated immediate recovery from amounts that depended on further information.", "t0": 36.42, "t1": 40.72, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": 